        <mxCell id="3vETicvla-XjMbYX95iE-57" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 80%;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;• Quality Gate via SonarQube&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 93, 93)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(semua hasil Horusec/Trivy/Linter terkonsolidasi)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 93, 93)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;• Configuration Policy Gate via Conftest/OPA&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 93, 93)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(config deployment tidak sesuai policy → gagal)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 93, 93)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;• Advisory Otomatis berbasis AI/LLM&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 93, 93)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(developer langsung tahu apa yang diperbaiki)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 93, 93)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;• Konsolidasi Temuan lintas alat&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 93, 93)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(mengurangi risiko VA lolos)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 93, 93)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;• Continuous Feedback ke developer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 93, 93)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(mempercepat perbaikan dan respons keamanan)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 93, 93)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 93, 93)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 93, 93)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;pengurangan kompleksitas teknis&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 93, 93)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 93, 93)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 93, 93)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;peningkatan kualitas keamanan aplikasi)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontFamily=Times New Roman;labelBackgroundColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#005D5D);" parent="3vETicvla-XjMbYX95iE-56" vertex="1">
